    narr:narration """The narrative surrounding [decision capture at the point of consensus](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) has evolved from a foundational product thesis into a concrete delivery framework. As of July 2026, the focus has shifted toward [validating the delivery evidence chain](narr:Position_Sprint4DeliveryEvidenceChain) for this core feature. Recent updates from the team emphasize tangible milestones, noting that they have [shipped the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785406405073_1) and identified the [Zephyr integration as a key unlock](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785406405073_3) for progress. Performance metrics are also being integrated into this narrative, with reports of [record-high velocity](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785406405073_2) serving as a proxy for the successful implementation of these decision-capture capabilities.""" ;
